{"id":"no","lemma":"no","pos":"intj","rank":3,"glosses":["no","eh?, right?, isn't it? (used as a tag question, to emphasise what precedes, or to request that the listener express an opinion)"],"ipa":"/ˈno/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-no.wav","examples":[{"text":"No estoy de acuerdo.","en":"I disagree.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438244"},{"text":"No voy a ir.","en":"I won't go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438661"},{"text":"No le hagas caso.","en":"Ignore him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636547"},{"text":"No está en casa.","en":"He's not in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438401"},{"text":"Él no está adentro.","en":"He's not in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501235"}]}